# Sportner API — Architecture Rules

Before changing this codebase, read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at the repo root.
Follow it for every feature, fix, and refactor. Do not reintroduce fat controllers,
DbContext-in-controllers, or hardcoded user-facing strings.
